BALOCHISTAN JUNIPER UNIVERSITY ORDINANCE, 1996
BALOCHISTAN JUNIPER UNIVERSITY
ORDINANCE, 1996
An Ordinance to provide for the
establishment of Juniper University
[Gazette of Balochistan,
Extraordinary, 14th December, 1996]
No. LEGIS.I‑108/LAW/96,
dated 14‑12‑1996. The following Ordinance made by the Governor of
Balochistan on 30th November, 1996, is hereby published for general
information:‑‑---
2. Definitions.‑‑ In
this Ordinance, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject, or context:‑‑
(a) "Advisory Board"
means the Advisory Board of the Junipur University;
(b) "Board" means the
Board of Governors of the Juniper University;
(c) "Board of Trustees"
means Board of Trustees;
(d) "Chancellor" means
the Chancellor of the Juniper University;
(e) "Committee" means
the Executive Committee of the Juniper University;
(f) "Council" means the
Governing Council of the University;
(g) "Dean" means the
academic head of the Faculty of the University;
(h) "Director" means
the Director of an Institute of the University;
(i) "Patron" means the
patron of the University;
(j) "President" means
the President of the Society;
(k) "Pro‑Vice‑Chancellor"
means the Pro‑Vice‑Chancellor of the University;
(l) "Regulation" means
the Regulations framed under this Ordinance;
(m) "Rules" means the
rules framed under this Ordinance;
(n) "Society" means the
Juniper Education Society formed under the Societies Registration Act, 1860
(XXI of 1860);
(o) "Teacher" means the
Professors, Associate Professors, Assistant Professors, Lecturers and Research
Staff engaged by the University, or such other persons as may be recognized as
teachers;
(p) "Vice‑Chancellor"
means the Vice‑Chancellor of the University;
(q) "University" means
the Junipur University;
